        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-105064",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Based on the feedback received from employees, we have developed multiple strategic initiatives focused on culture, specifically on promoting a positive employee experience, as well as focusing on career development.",
        "start_character": 20160,
        "end_character": 20376
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-105064",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-105064-92c41a3da24a58b5",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-105064",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In certain instances, citizen groups also have the ability to bring legal proceedings against us if we are not in compliance with environmental laws, or to challenge our ability to receive environmental permits that we need to operate.",
        "start_character": 29240,
        "end_character": 29475
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-105064",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-105064-92c41a3da24a58b5",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-105064",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The water and critical infrastructure markets in which we operate are competitive and include larger national firms such as Barnard Construction Company, Inc., Ames Construction Inc., Flatiron Dragados, Fluor Corporation, Granite Construction Incorporated, Kiewit Corporation, Skanska USA Inc., Traylor Bros., Inc., and The Walsh Group, as well as smaller regional contractors, particularly in California.",
        "start_character": 22110,
        "end_character": 22515
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-105064",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-105064-92c41a3da24a58b5",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-105064",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To capitalize on this opportunity, we launched Axia Electric during 2025, a dedicated electrical subsidiary designed to meet growing market demand for specialized, high-performance electrical and power distribution solutions.",
        "start_character": 10806,
        "end_character": 11031
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-105064",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-105064-92c41a3da24a58b5",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-105064",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also construct projects that are designed to protect regions from flooding.",
        "start_character": 15932,
        "end_character": 16010
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-105064",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-105064-92c41a3da24a58b5",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-105064",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also encourage our employees to continue to develop in their careers by obtaining advanced degrees or professional certifications.",
